#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth_sparkling_chasm"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As you fall into the chasm, you see a multitude of stars, spots, and other "
"shapes.  It's like your sinking ever further into a liquid solution, and "
"falling through the air at the same time.  Your head throbs with pain as the "
"pressure increases, and you black out.  When you come to, you're back in "
"reality disoriented but unharmed."
msgstr ""

