msgid "Chunks of reality tear themselves asunder and take shape on the ground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shape came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shapes came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
