"several things glide into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping "
"between the spaces between atoms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
